{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the faith. Question everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belor</strong> is an isometric visual novel with light management mechanics and multiple endings, set in a dark, grounded medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Live the history of the Pilgrim, a devoted priest to <strong>Belor</strong>, sent by the Cathedral of Luz to a forgotten village to spread the word of his Savior, the hero who ascended to divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you deepen in the daily life of the village, you make cults and know the residents better, you can discover secrets and find hidden endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build. Ask. Discover.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage village resources</strong> and organize weekly activities \u2014 growth comes at a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the locals</strong>: form bonds, bring in new followers, or uncover forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade the temple</strong> and lead sacred rituals \u2014 but be wary of what you awaken.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One path. Multiple endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no fixed timeline</strong> \u2014 the game ends when you reach one of its multiple conclusions.<br> Bring followers back to the Cathedral... or uncover something that should have stayed buried.<br> Your choices shape the story \u2014 and determine who you become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A somber, immersive visual experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique isometric visuals that amplify the game's oppressive and mysterious tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich soundscape designed to unsettle and immerse, blending the sacred with the profane.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799410?t=1750443736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799410/b479c3beab92ecb3e2f8ba62eab251d18e353d52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750443736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799410/82dee31da3fb7e29a79cae3d360bf8c4e1074d0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750443736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799410/82dee31da3fb7e29a79cae3d360bf8c4e1074d0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750443736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the faith. Question everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belor</strong> is an isometric visual novel with light management mechanics and multiple endings, set in a dark, grounded medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Live the history of the Pilgrim, a devoted priest to <strong>Belor</strong>, sent by the Cathedral of Luz to a forgotten village to spread the word of his Savior, the hero who ascended to divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you deepen in the daily life of the village, you make cults and know the residents better, you can discover secrets and find hidden endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build. Ask. Discover.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage village resources</strong> and organize weekly activities \u2014 growth comes at a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the locals</strong>: form bonds, bring in new followers, or uncover forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade the temple</strong> and lead sacred rituals \u2014 but be wary of what you awaken.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One path. Multiple endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no fixed timeline</strong> \u2014 the game ends when you reach one of its multiple conclusions.<br> Bring followers back to the Cathedral... or uncover something that should have stayed buried.<br> Your choices shape the story \u2014 and determine who you become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A somber, immersive visual experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique isometric visuals that amplify the game's oppressive and mysterious tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich soundscape designed to unsettle and immerse, blending the sacred with the profane.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pixel Chicken Studio "],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799410/08ce2b61663a1210f8a748636a24ac9819dddb1f/header.jpg?t=1750443736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799410/958931480/dbff9029d6095a0701a0e1071bd2b0243e7e6301/1750370785/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750443728","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799410/958931480/dbff9029d6095a0701a0e1071bd2b0243e7e6301/1750370785/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750443728","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799410/958931480/dbff9029d6095a0701a0e1071bd2b0243e7e6301/1750370785/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750443728","id":257151153,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151153/movie480.mp4?t=1750443728","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151153/movie_max.mp4?t=1750443728"},"name":"Belor-Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151153/a7d428690e61b4aa0bf6b79328b242840711c15d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750443728","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers